<resources>
    <string name="about_body1">ClipNote is a free service that turns a link into a share card.</string>
    <string name="about_body2">Paste a link and it reads the title, description, and cover image automatically, then builds a card that reads at a glance on messengers and social — plus a short URL.</string>
    <string name="about_body3">It also handles links that usually don\'t preview well, like Naver Cafe posts and Instagram reels.</string>
    <string name="about_how1">Paste the link you want to share. Title, description, and cover image fill in automatically.</string>
    <string name="about_how2">Press “%1$s” and you get a short URL that shows the share card first. After that, the same button becomes “%2$s”.</string>
    <string name="about_how3">Just need the address without the card? “%s” copies the title and the original URL together.</string>
    <string name="about_how4">“%1$s” keeps it for later, sorted by tag. Before you sign in, “%2$s” keeps it on this device only.</string>
