    <string name="faq_a1">“%1$s” is the short URL ClipNote created. Opening it shows the share card first, then goes to the original. “%2$s” skips the card and copies the title and original URL as-is. Short URLs require signing in.</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">When you create a clip, add up to 6 tags in the tag field, separated by commas. Tap a tag on the ‘%s’ screen to see only clips with that tag. Tags you\'ve used before are suggested under “Recent tags” so you can add them in one tap.</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Yes. You can save links on this device without an account. Creating short share links requires signing in with Google or Kakao.</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Yes. Dedicated extractors pull Naver Cafe post titles and Instagram reel or post details. Private and members-only posts may be limited.</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">The preview card appears briefly, then it moves on to the original page.</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Yes, it\'s free to use.</string>
